        { "path": ["documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>実行者が作成した Explod の位置を、作成時に決まった基準点へ結合しておく時間を変更します。<code>ID</code> で対象を選び、<code>Time</code> または代替書式の <code>value</code> で結合時間を指定します。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["explodbindtime-local-2002", "explodbindtime-local-1.0", "explodbindtime-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "literal", "value": -1, "display": "すべてのExplod", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["explodbindtime-local-2002", "explodbindtime-local-1.0", "explodbindtime-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>変更する Explod のIDを整数式で指定します。省略時の <code>-1</code> は実行者が作成したすべての Explod を対象にします。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["explodbindtime-local-2002", "explodbindtime-local-1.0", "explodbindtime-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "literal", "value": 1, "display": "1 tick", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["explodbindtime-local-2002", "explodbindtime-local-1.0", "explodbindtime-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>Explod を位置の基準点へ結合しておくゲーム tick 数を整数式で指定します。省略時は <code>1</code>、<code>-1</code> なら無期限です。MUGEN 1.0 / 1.1 の公式資料は、別のコントローラーが結合時間を変更するまでと補足します。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["explodbindtime-local-2002", "explodbindtime-local-1.0", "explodbindtime-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 2, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 2, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "literal", "value": 1, "display": "Timeの代替書式", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["explodbindtime-local-2002", "explodbindtime-local-1.0", "explodbindtime-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 2, "documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p><code>Time</code> の代わりに同じ結合時間を指定する書式です。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["explodbindtime-local-2002", "explodbindtime-local-1.0", "explodbindtime-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 2, "constraints"], "value": [{ "kind": "alias", "parameters": ["Time"], "description": "value は Time の代替書式。", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["explodbindtime-local-2002", "explodbindtime-local-1.0", "explodbindtime-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 2, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
